UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Query? What do you think I''m here for, tea and biscuits? Spill the beans already!', BroadcastTextId=30565, Sound=14263 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=19 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Tell me how the dwarves came to be, and start at the beginning!', BroadcastTextId=30566, Sound=14264 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=20 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Right, right... I know the earthen were made from stone to shape the deep regions o'' the world. But what about the anomalies? Matrix non-stabilizin'' and what-not?', BroadcastTextId=30567, Sound=14265 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=21 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Necrowhatinthe-- Speak bloody Common, will ye?', BroadcastTextId=30568, Sound=14266 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=22 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Old Gods, huh? So they zapped the earthen with this Curse of Flesh... and then what?', BroadcastTextId=30577, Sound=14267 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=23 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='If they killed the Old Gods, Azeroth would''ve been destroyed...', BroadcastTextId=30578, Sound=14268 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=24 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='What protectors?', BroadcastTextId=30579, Sound=14269 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=25 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Aesir and Vanir... Okay, so the Forge o'' Wills started makin'' new earthen... but what happened to the old ones?', BroadcastTextId=30580, Sound=14270 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=26 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Hold everything! The Aesir and Vanir went to war? Why?', BroadcastTextId=30581, Sound=14271 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=27 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='This "Loken" sounds like a nasty character. Glad we don''t have to worry about the likes o'' him anymore. So... if I''m understandin'' ye right, the original earthen eventually woke up from this stasis, and by that time the destabili-whatever had turned ''em into proper dwarves. Or at least... dwarf ancestors.', BroadcastTextId=30582, Sound=14272 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=28 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Well, now... that''s a lot to digest. I''m gonna need some time to take all this in. Thank ye.', BroadcastTextId=30583, Sound=14273 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=29 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Loken?! That''s downright bothersome... We might''ve neutralized the iron dwarves, but I''d lay odds there''s another machine somewhere else churnin'' out a whole mess o'' these iron vrykul!', BroadcastTextId=28591, Sound=14278 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=30 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='I''ll use the forge to make batches o'' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!', BroadcastTextId=30584, Sound=14279 WHERE CreatureID=28070 AND GroupID=31 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Seem like there more wasps every time Dajik come back. Why they not run out?', BroadcastTextId=28189, Sound=14212 WHERE CreatureID=28215 AND GroupID=3 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='I will not simply lay here and allow you to slay me! You will have to earn your right to draw another breath if you want to kill me, mortal!', BroadcastTextId=28544, Sound=478 WHERE CreatureID=28416 AND GroupID=0 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='But try they must or all will be lost. The Drakkari will be the death of both themselves and their gods!', BroadcastTextId=28435, Sound=473 WHERE CreatureID=28514 AND GroupID=0 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='The spotted one must be sought. Their fates are entwined.', BroadcastTextId=28432, Sound=9919 WHERE CreatureID=28515 AND GroupID=0 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='To her altar this mortal must travel. What they must do will not be easy. In the end it may prove impossible.', BroadcastTextId=28434, Sound=643 WHERE CreatureID=28517 AND GroupID=0 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Who''s that beatin'' on my drum?', BroadcastTextId=28627, Sound=12009 WHERE CreatureID=28636 AND GroupID=0 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='I''ve returned to invite you to my housewarming in the underworld!', BroadcastTextId=28842, Sound=7056 WHERE CreatureID=28785 AND GroupID=1 AND ID=0;
UPDATE world.creature_text SET Text='Death is the only escape!', BroadcastTextId=171259, Sound=0 WHERE CreatureID=28890 AND GroupID=2 AND ID=0;
